# Shared by every image built from the monorepo root:
#   docker build -f Dockerfile            → backend API  (Coolify Location /Dockerfile)
#   docker build -f frontend/Dockerfile   → React SPA    (Coolify Location /frontend/Dockerfile)
#
# Context MUST be the repository root so both images can COPY packages/shared.
# Do NOT exclude frontend/ or packages/shared/ (SPA build).
# Do NOT exclude backend/ (API build).
# Do NOT set Coolify Base Directory to /frontend or /backend.

.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
node_modules
**/node_modules
coverage
dist
build
.astro
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
web/src
web/astro.config.mjs
web/tailwind.config.ts
web/tsconfig.json
docs
*.md
.cursor
.vscode
.idea
